---
---

<section class="experience">
  <div class="experience__image">
    <img src="/images/dinner-savanna.png" alt="Candlelit dinner under acacia trees on the Tanzanian savanna" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="experience__image-overlay"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="experience__content container">
    <div class="experience__text">
      <span class="section-label">The HAO Difference</span>
      <h2>Safari is about<br />how it feels</h2>
      <p>
        We obsess over every detail of your journey — from the campfire conversations with your guide to the way your tent frames the morning light. The wild is magnificent; our role is to make you feel completely at home within it.
      </p>

      <div class="experience__features">
        <div class="experience__feature">
          <span class="experience__feature-num">01</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Expert-Led Always</h4>
            <p>Every expedition is led by a certified naturalist guide with a minimum of eight years in the field.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience__feature">
          <span class="experience__feature-num">02</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Handpicked Camps</h4>
            <p>We partner only with camps that share our commitment to low-impact, high-experience hospitality.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="experience__feature">
          <span class="experience__feature-num">03</span>
          <div>
            <h4>Real Flexibility</h4>
            <p>Safari doesn't run on a schedule. We adapt in real time — chasing sightings, extending drives, changing routes as the wilderness dictates.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <a href="#contact" class="btn-gold">Start Planning</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .experience {
    position: relative;
    min-height: 640px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .experience__image {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 0;
  }

  .experience__image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
  }

  .experience__image-overlay {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(
      to right,
      rgba(10, 26, 16, 0.92) 0%,
      rgba(10, 26, 16, 0.7) 55%,
      rgba(10, 26, 16, 0.25) 100%
    );
  }

  .experience__content {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    padding-top: var(--section-padding);
    padding-bottom: var(--section-padding);
  }

  .experience__text {
    max-width: 540px;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .experience__text h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    color: var(--white);
  }

  .experience__text > p {
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    max-width: 44ch;
  }

  .experience__features {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .experience__feature {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    align-items: flex-start;
  }

  .experience__feature-num {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--gold);
    line-height: 1;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 2.5rem;
  }

  .experience__feature h4 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--white);
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .experience__feature p {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: rgba(255,255,255,0.65);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 38ch;
  }
</style>
